{"id":"476bf6706c15594f","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-stage-jump-limit.md","title":"跳跃阶段指标的极限判据","display":"lem-stage-jump-limit — 跳跃阶段指标的极限判据","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-stage-jump-limit","aliases":["20-lem-stage-jump-limit"],"display":"lem-stage-jump-limit — 跳跃阶段指标的极限判据","chapter":"7","section":"7.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"§7.2.2","source_printed_pages":[150],"source_pdf_pages":[184],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-stage-jump-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-stage-jump-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-stage-jump-limit — 跳跃阶段指标的极限判据"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§7.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>150</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>184</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d81dfad676f32c4a\" href=\"?note=d81dfad676f32c4a\" title=\"20-thm-shoenfield-limit\">20-thm-shoenfield-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 为统一可计算递增有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_sA_s\">\\(A=\\bigcup_sA_s\\)</span>。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall t\\ \\exists s\\ge t\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(e)\\downarrow])\\Rightarrow\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\">\\((\\forall t\\ \\exists s\\ge t\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(e)\\downarrow])\\Rightarrow\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e,s)=1\">\\(h(e,s)=1\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(e)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(e)\\downarrow\\)</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e,s)=0\">\\(h(e,s)=0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d81dfad676f32c4a\" href=\"?note=d81dfad676f32c4a\" title=\"20-thm-shoenfield-limit\">20-thm-shoenfield-limit</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}stage\\text{-}jump\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\ [\\lim_s h(e,s)=\\chi_{A&#39;}(e)],\\qquad\\operatorname{Low}_1(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}stage\\text{-}jump\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\ [\\lim_s h(e,s)=\\chi_{A&#39;}(e)],\\qquad\\operatorname{Low}_1(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 是统一可计算的 0/1 函数。真实计算若停止，其有限查询集合的成员位在递增近似中最终稳定，因此充分晚的阶段都显示同一停止计算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e,s)\">\\(h(e,s)\\)</span> 最终为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。真实计算若发散，假设排除了无限多个假停止阶段，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e,s)\">\\(h(e,s)\\)</span> 最终为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。极限引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，跳跃单调性给出反向归约。</p>\n<p>有限损伤只是用于证明这里的假设的一种办法；单有“某个损伤记录有限”并不直接推出低性。</p>\n<p>来源：§7.2.2；印刷页 150；PDF 第 184 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-shoenfield-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved